# Supabase / Postgres

- One migration per concern; name `YYYYMMDDHHMMSS_description.sql`.
- **RLS required** on all user-facing tables. Match `docs/MVP.md` §4 (`mwc_contractors`, `search_cache`, etc.).
- Do not seed real PII in migrations. Phone indexes must match app-layer normalization.
- Do not add tables “for future features” — only what MVP or an approved DEC requires.
